WRT_Xo
ANI_Xo
SET_Y_NAME Yo
WRT_Yo
ANI_Yo
SET_Z_NAME Zo
WRT_Zo
ANI_Zo
SET_YAW_NAME Yaw
WRT_Yaw
ANI_Yaw
SET_PITCH_NAME Pitch
WRT_Pitch
ANI_Pitch
SET_ROLL_NAME Roll_E
WRT_Roll_E
ANI_Roll_E
PARSFILE Payloads\Custom\Custom_28a78a3c-9df3-4bfc-a830-2dc2e37f9883.par
#BlueLink1 Payload: Custom`Roof Cargo Box` ` , Miscellaneous`Custom_28a78a3c-9df3-4bfc-a830-2dc2e37f9883

